{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13560","headline":"献薛仆射 · 秦系","name":"献薛仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来那敢议轻肥，散发行歌自采薇。\n逋客未能忘野兴，辟书翻遣脱荷衣。\n家中匹妇空相笑，池上羣鸥尽欲飞。\n更乞大贤容小隐，益看愚谷有光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}